#ASSERT `Commencement: the unit of the Law is in force on` (`a Part of the Law` 4) (YMD 2018 5 1) `the favoured interpretation`
#ASSERT NOT `Commencement: the unit of the Law is in force on` (`a Part of the Law` 4) (YMD 2018 4 30) `the favoured interpretation`
